WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
He can't run away

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,600
How on earth can you save us?

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:09,060
There are too many zombies in our building. Don't send me away. Please disperse.

4
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,440
Fix the other end

5
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,500
People, please hold on tight. I'll go there first.

6
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:26,390
Rescue finally comes

7
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:30,080
There are zombies outside

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,500
You have been trapped in this small room

9
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,480
Originally there were no zombies on this floor

10
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,000
To save him last time

11
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,360
Luring all the zombies here

12
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,260
Didn’t I bring you supplies back?

13
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,620
I'm not the one you want to leave the frost

14
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,780
will you take it out
